sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Governed harness
  participant Ag as Builder agent
  participant C as Candidate
  participant V as External verifier
  participant G as Protected contracts and Gate
  H->>Ag: task, public contract, mandate and budget
  loop until PASS or budget exhausted
    Ag->>C: modifies the candidate
    Ag->>Ag: runs its own tests
    H->>V: runs the pinned candidate
    V->>G: reads baseline and anchor
    V-->>H: PASS, FAIL or INCONCLUSIVE
    H-->>Ag: feedback allowed by the protocol
  end
  H->>H: records model, prompt, tools and cost
